[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7724.069, "timestamp": "02:08:44", "text": "搞什么鬼？ 嗯？ 等等，他是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7725.75, "timestamp": "02:08:45", "text": "叛徒。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7736.55, "timestamp": "02:08:56", "text": "我们这样的凯伦们，再也不能和那些爱炫耀"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7739.27, "timestamp": "02:08:59", "text": "、爱搞怪的人为伍了？ 我将我的异族献给被"}]